   "x": 200,
   "w": 782,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A trial of a new consultation-queue design cut the wait for a doctor's first reply by nearly a third and almost eliminated long waits. It did not move the completion rate overall, but it did reshape who drops out, and it hurt one department badly: dermatology lost 4.5 points of completion ."
