   "w": 773,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Users of an online consultation service were split into a control arm and a test arm and followed for six weeks. Each row is one consultation: who the user was, which department and complaint, when they entered the queue, whether they were lost before a doctor answered, whether the consultation completed, how long the doctor took to respond, how long the consultation ran, and whether the user came back within seven days."
