   "w": 773,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Time to a doctor's first reply falls by about 48 seconds on average and by 22 seconds at the median. More importantly, the slow end of the distribution is compressed: the 90th percentile drops from 234 s to 177 s and the 95th from 290 s to 213 s. Waits over five minutes — the ones users notice and abandon over — fall from 4.48% of measured sessions to 1.06%."
