   "x": 200,
   "w": 729,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Every department, platform and complaint improves, but by very different amounts. Gynecology shows the largest fall — from 210.4 s to 97.2 s — because its control-arm queue was the slowest. The WeChat mini-program arm falls from 198.2 s to 104.3 s, and the 25 complaint types go from a 12.6 s gain (chest tightness) up to a 315.6 s gain (heavy periods)."
