   "y": 2986,
   "x": 200,
   "w": 773,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Headline completion is unchanged: 7,903 of 8,987 test consultations finish (87.9%) against 7,933 of 9,013 in control (88.0%). Underneath that flat total, users lost before a doctor ever answered rise from 427 (4.74%) to 476 (5.30%) — and that increase is not spread evenly."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3087,
   "x": 732,
   "w": 508,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Dermatology is the exception to an otherwise benign read-out. Completion there falls from 85.0% (1,376 of 1,618) to 80.5% (1,210 of 1,503), a 4.5-point drop with a two-proportion z of −3.35 — far outside what sampling noise would produce at this sample size."
  },
