   "x": 732,
   "w": 508,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The mechanism is visible one column over: the share of dermatology users who leave the queue before a doctor answers doubles, from 7.7% to 12.7%. Pediatrics moves the other way, from 3.1% to 2.5%, and its completion rate rises from 88.9% to 90.4%."
