  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3470,
   "x": 759,
   "w": 457,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "back spots (后背长了不少小红点) 6.9% → 13.9% hives (荨麻疹反反复复两个星期) 9.0% → 13.5% acne (脸上爆痘,下巴最严重) 6.9% → 12.1% itchy rash (手臂上起红疹,特别痒) 9.7% → 11.9% athlete's foot (脚趾缝脱皮发痒) 6.0% → 11.7%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3630,
   "x": 732,
   "w": 508,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Dermatology was also the slowest department to complete in control (85.0%) and the fastest to improve its response time (153.0 s → 99.9 s), so faster triage did not translate into more finished skin consultations. Skin complaints are the most visual and the most likely to be ones a user abandons if the first answer feels like a form reply — a plausible but untested explanation, since the data records no reason for the exit."
