  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 4330,
   "x": 200,
   "w": 773,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completed consultations run about a minute and a half shorter in the test arm — 11.7 minutes against 13.1 on average, 10.4 against 11.2 at the median — so the time saved at the front of the queue is not spent back at the end."
  },
